    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "gmnotes": "",
      "short": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>You launch an opponent’s mind forward in time, forcing them to experience a day’s events in a moment. The target takes 4d8 damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.conditions.Item.JGFn4MrDZ6X5vrzU]{Fatigued} for the duration, or they become @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.conditions.Item.33ynSbmexuxC3cAQ]{Exhausted} for the duration if already fatigued. The target can attempt a Will saving throw to halve the damage dealt by this spell and negate the fatigued condition.</p>"
    },
